Starship Ship 43 has arrived to Massey's for its cryo testing campaign, 4 days after its potential flight 16 partner Booster 23 returned from its cryo campaign. 
Could this be the first Ship to fly out of the Kennedy Space Center?
@NASASpaceflight | https://t.co/1bbXAEmS9g https://t.co/LJH783KUCs

Flew over Starbase this afternoon. Pad 2 looking clean and ready for Flight 14, Pad 1 coming together. Gigabay almost ready, Ship 42 on cryo at Massey’s. 
The pace down here is absolutely insane
